Package: ppbr
Type: Package
Title: Posterior Predictive Bracketing and Resolution Dose Finding
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("PPBR", "Development Team", email = "haocstats@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements posterior predictive bracketing and resolution for
    phase I dose-finding trials with ordered doses and binary toxicity outcomes.
    The package supports trial specification, interim and terminal decisions,
    posterior summaries, visualization, and operating-characteristic simulation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: graphics, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/haohaostats/PPBR
BugReports: https://github.com/haohaostats/PPBR/issues
